    given-names: Johann
    affiliation: MOR Research Collective

abstract: >
  GenesisAeon Package 22. Implements the BTW (Bak-Tang-Wiesenfeld) and
  Manna stochastic sandpile models as UTAC (Universal Threshold-Activity
  Cascade) continuous phase transitions, calibrated against
  Phys. Rev. E 111, 024111 (2025). Provides the complete CREP Criticality
  Spectrum Atlas mapping Γ values across all GenesisAeon domains
  (solar flares, Amazon forest, AMOC, neural criticality, sandpile SOC).

keywords:
  - self-organized criticality
  - sandpile model
  - BTW
  - Manna
  - phase transition
  - CREP tensor
  - UTAC
  - GenesisAeon

